Oh, no. Our office staff,
Natsume, does.

264
00:16:15,813 --> 00:16:17,271
I haven't done anything.

265
00:16:19,105 --> 00:16:22,105
We got the plants from the previous owner.

266
00:16:22,188 --> 00:16:25,396
You could say Natsume works here
because she likes them so much.

267
